          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwo kwezi nyene, Abisirayeli bakoranira hamwe, bisonzesheje, bambaye amagunira bisuriyeko umukungugu ku mitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakomoka kuri Isirayeli bose bari bitandukanije n’abanyamahanga bose. Bahagarara mu bibanza vyabo batura ivyaha vyabo n’ibibi vyose ba sekuruza bari barakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahagarara aho bari bari maze basoma mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vy’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yabo amasaha atandatu, bongera bamara ayandi masaha atandatu batura ivyaha vyabo basenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi bari bahagaze ku ngazi: Yesuwa, Bani, Kadimiyeli, Shebaniya, Buni, Sherebiya, Bani na Kenani, bambaza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yabo n’ijwi rirenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abalewi ari bo Yesuwa, Kadimiyeli, Bani, Hashabuneya, Sherebiya, Hodiya, Shebaniya na Petahiya, baravuga bati: “Nimuhaguruke muhimbaze ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu, yamyeho kandi izokwamaho.” Barasenga bati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
